      <span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">STATUTORY CLEARANCE</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for Packers To Pune Packers And Movers</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When it comes to relocating household goods from one place to another, especially within India, it's essential to understand the various statutory requirements and risk coverage options provided by reputable packers and movers companies. In this article, we'll discuss the key aspects:</p>

	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e-Way Bills:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All transportation of goods, including household goods, is subject to the Goods and Services Tax (GST). To ensure smooth transit, packers and movers issue GST e-Way Bills. These bills serve as proof of payment for goods being transported and help avoid any tax-related issues during transit.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To provide an added layer of security, some packers and movers issue IBA-approved Lorry Receipts. These receipts are issued by the Indian Bankers' Association (IBA) and are recognized across the country.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Traffic Permits:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In some cases, transportation of household goods may require obtaining Traffic Permits. These permits are issued by local authorities to ensure smooth movement of goods on specific routes and dates.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To protect both the client and the packers and movers, it's crucial to understand the risk coverage options provided:</p>

	<h3>1. 100% Declared Value IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
	<p>Most reputable packers and movers offer <strong>100% Declared Value IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance</strong>. This coverage insures the goods against accidental collision or unforeseen delays during transit. It ensures that in the event of a loss or damage to your household goods, you are compensated for the full declared value of your belongings.</p>

	<h3>2. Comprehensive Transit Insurance</h3>
	<p>In addition to the IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance, some packers and movers provide <strong>Comprehensive Transit Insurance</strong>. This coverage goes beyond accidental collisions and unforeseen delays, offering protection against any other damages incurred during transit.</p>

	<h3>3. Insurance Information and Documentation</h3>
	<p>To ensure a seamless and secure relocation process, packers and movers provide detailed <strong>Insurance Information and Documentation</strong>. This includes the policy documents, insurance coverage details, and any relevant clauses or exclusions.</p>

	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">If you have additional questions or queries regarding statutory paperwork and risk coverage provided by packers and movers, feel free to consult with the company directly.</p>
